# Demon's Crest attract route — boot, story intro and the first gameplay
# scene, with no player input. 24000 frames (~6.7 minutes of guest time) was
# enough to reach gameplay on the verified scaffold.
#
# Used by the headless smoke tests and coverage capture runs:
#   SNESRECOMP_TIER2_CAPTURE=1 SNESRECOMP_COVERAGE_DIR=... \
#   ./build/DemonsCrestSNESRecomp "<rom>" --script scripts/routes/attract.script
#
# `turbo on` changes presentation pacing only (no guest frames are added),
# so traces and captures are identical to a normal-paced run.
turbo on
wait 24000
quit
